The Java call site is settled by [ADR-0001](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/java-sdk/adr/0001-mixed-lang-dag-interface.md) (merged in #72019); this PR implements its **binding half**. The wire contract is [ADR-0007](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/airflow-core/adr/lang-sdk/0007-taskflow-across-language-boundary.md).

## Example

Three authoring syntaxes, exactly the three ADR-0001 specifies. All resolve to the same bindings.

### 1. Annotation based with positional injection

```java
