Syntax 1 compiles to this — copied out of the example project's generated sources:

```java
public static final class ConsumeDoubleList implements Task {
  @Override
  public void execute(Context context, Client client) throws Exception {
    TaskArgs args = TaskArgs.of(context, client);
    List<Double> values = args.get(0, new TypeRef<List<Double>>() {});
    new XComCastingExample().consumeDoubleList(values);
  }
